criteria.text:
`ls apps/dotln/public/i18n` lists no `catalog` entry;
   `npm run check:bundle` passes, so no catalog source has entered the
   initial bundle; `package.json`'s `dependencies` keys equal the integrated base's;
   and `docs/evidence/WO-035/README.md` records the initial bundle, transfer
   and registration figures of step 12.

The persisted-state spec asserts every key written starts with `dotln-angular.twin` and no other storage, cookie or network write occurs, and a second spec seeds that key with a value that does not parse and with one naming an unknown variant and asserts the facade yields the first registry entry with no flips;
   `grep -rlE "from 'node:|from \"node:|require\(" libs/shared/replay/src libs/shared/twin-model/src libs/features/twin/src libs/features/twin-data-access/src --include='*.ts' | grep -v spec`
   prints nothing.

**Documents and scripts.** `docs/dev-reference/architecture/catalog.md`
    carries the heading `Mining a new work`;
    `docs/ai-reference/catalog-rules.md` states that a map row may carry
    the public text's maxim verbatim where the maxim is the concept;
    `docs/dev-reference/workspace/scripts.md` names the `--batch` join in
    the `catalog:join` row; `npm run check:scripts` exits 0.

